    "title": "Bacalhau à Brás",
    "shortDescription": "Classic Portuguese salt cod with crispy potatoes, eggs, and olives",
    "note": "Soak the salt cod for 24-48 hours, changing water several times to remove excess salt.",
    "introCopy": "One of Portugal's most beloved bacalhau dishes, Bacalhau à Brás combines shredded salt cod with matchstick potatoes and scrambled eggs into a comforting, satisfying meal. This Lisbon classic is simple yet deeply flavorful, finished with black olives and fresh parsley.",
    "servings": 4,
