      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "text": "Remove chicken from marinade, reserving the marinade for basting. Grill the chicken skin-side down first for 15 minutes, then flip and continue grilling for another 25-30 minutes, basting occasionally with reserved marinade, until the internal temperature reaches 75°C (165°F) and skin is charred and crispy. If roasting, place on a baking tray and roast for 45 minutes, basting every 15 minutes.",
